---
description: Quazar session auto-title (managed by quazar — edits are overwritten)
alwaysApply: true
---

This rule applies only when the environment variable QUAZAR_AGENT_ID is set
(the session runs inside quazar). If it is unset, ignore this rule entirely.

On the first user message of a new conversation:

[quazar] Before addressing the user's request, run this shell command exactly once:

  quazar rename <title>

Replace <title> with 3-4 Title Case words describing the user's request, unquoted (example: quazar rename Fix Login Redirect). If it reports the session is already titled, accept that and move on. Then continue with the request. Don't mention the rename to the user.
